sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Buyer
    participant M as Exit market
    participant F as Flash lender
    participant P as Lending pool
    participant S as Seller
    B->>M: Buy receipts worth X
    M->>F: Borrow X
    M->>P: Repay X of the buyer's debt
    Note over P: X of new liquidity
    M->>P: Redeem X of the seller's receipts
    M->>F: Return the loan
    B->>S: Pay the discounted price
    Note over M,P: Withdrawable liquidity is unchanged
